*Add to tailwind.config.ts: `fontFamily: { heading: ['Montserrat', 'sans-serif'] }`

### Text size + line-height scale
Figma text style name format: `text-{size}/{leading}/{weight}`
- `leading-normal` = the px line-height listed in the table below
- `leading-none`   = 100% (line-height equals font-size)

| Size token | font-size | line-height (normal) | Tailwind size | Font family |
|---|-----|----|---|----|
| text-xxs   | 10px      | 12px                 | `text-[10px]` | Inter       |
| text-xs    | 12px      | 16px                 | `text-xs`     | Inter       |
| text-sm    | 14px      | 20px                 | `text-sm`     | Inter       |
| text-base  | 16px      | 24px                 | `text-base`   | Inter       |
| text-lg    | 18px      | 28px                 | `text-lg`     | Inter       |
| text-xl    | 20px      | 28px                 | `text-xl`     | Inter       |
| text-2xl   | 24px      | 32px                 | `text-2xl`    | Montserrat  |
| text-3xl   | 30px      | 36px                 | `text-3xl`    | Montserrat  |
| text-4xl   | 36px      | 40px                 | `text-4xl`    | Montserrat  |
| text-5xl   | 48px      | 48px                 | `text-5xl`    | Montserrat  |
| text-6xl   | 60px      | 60px                 | `text-6xl`    | Montserrat  |
| text-7xl   | 72px      | 72px                 | `text-7xl`    | Montserrat  |
| text-8xl   | 96px      | 96px                 | `text-8xl`    | Montserrat  |
| text-9xl   | 128px     | 128px                | `text-9xl`    | Montserrat  |

RULE: text-xxs through text-xl -> use `font-sans` (Inter).
text-2xl and above -> use `font-heading` (Montserrat).

