## 11. SHADCN/UI COMPONENT RULES

When a Figma frame contains a recognizable shadcn component, always import it from
`@/components/ui` rather than building from scratch.

### Component -> token mapping
| shadcn component | Key tokens                                                         |
|---|-----|
| `<Button>`       | `primary` bg + `primary-foreground`; `rounded-md`; `text-sm font-medium` |
| `<Card>`         | `card` bg + `card-foreground`; `border-border`; `shadow-sm`; `rounded-xl` |
| `<Input>`        | `input` border; `background` bg; `text-sm`; `rounded-md`; `h-10`  |
| `<Badge>`        | Status extraweak bg + bold text; `rounded-full`; `text-xs font-semibold` |
| `<Alert>`        | Status extraweak bg + bold foreground + status icon                |
| `<Sidebar>`      | All `sidebar-*` tokens                                             |
| `<Popover>`      | `popover` bg + `popover-foreground`; `shadow-md`; `rounded-lg`     |

### Variant -> color mapping
| Variant      | Background          | Text                        |
|-----|---|-----|
| default      | `primary`           | `primary-foreground`        |
| secondary    | `secondary`         | `secondary-foreground`      |
| outline      | transparent         | `foreground` + `border-border`|
| ghost        | transparent/`accent`| `foreground`                |
| destructive  | `destructive`       | `destructive-foreground`    |
| success      | `success-extraweak` | `success-bold`              |
| warning      | `warning-extraweak` | `warning-bold`              |
| info         | `info-extraweak`    | `info-bold`                 |

