## 12. LUCIDE ICONS RULES

- Always import from `lucide-react`: `import { IconName } from 'lucide-react'`
- Size must match surrounding text:

| Context              | Class     | px  |
|----|-----|-----|
| Inline with text-sm  | `size-4`  | 16  |
| Inline with text-base| `size-4`  | 16  |
| Inline with text-lg  | `size-5`  | 20  |
| Standalone / button  | `size-4` to `size-5` |  |
| Feature / hero icon  | `size-6` to `size-8` |  |

- Icon color must use a semantic token class: `text-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`,
  `text-destructive`, `text-success`, etc. Never a raw color.
- Never use emoji as icons.

