## 15. FORBIDDEN PATTERNS

```jsx
// Hardcoded colors
style={{ color: '#fe5b04' }}
className="text-[#fe5b04]"

// Arbitrary spacing not on the scale
className="p-[13px]"

// Raw font-size outside the scale
style={{ fontSize: '15px' }}

// Emoji as icon
<span>🔥</span>

// Rebuilding shadcn components
<button className="bg-orange-500 rounded px-4 py-2">

// Wrong font family for size
<h2 className="font-sans text-3xl">  // text-2xl+ must use font-heading
```
